# Transient state RepoMethod writes under .repomethod/ while updating managed
# files, workflow state, or skills. Patterns here are relative to this
# directory (the .gitignore lives inside .repomethod/). Do not commit these.
*.tmp.*
*.json.lock
*.json.lock/
backups/
evidence/*.scratch

# Supervisor sidecars: per-run bookkeeping only. The workflow state
# (workflows/<feature>.json) and the agent handoff
# (workflows/<feature>.handoff.json) ARE meant to be committed so a fresh
# agent can resume from a clean checkout. So is the rest of evidence/ —
# only the supervisor's own per-check gate logs are noise.
workflows/*.supervisor.json
workflows/*.dispatch.md
evidence/supervisor-*.log
